    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lost Vulcan - A roguelite platformer that revives the spirit of classic arcade games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The legend of Vulcan is calling you... will you answer the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the depths of space lies Vulcan, a colossal abandoned ship that hides legendary riches, deadly traps, and foes that will push even the most experienced bounty hunters to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master the art of arcade survival:</strong><br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfae Precise classic-style controls with the depth of modern roguelites<br>\u2022 \ud83e\udde9 6 unique zones filled with clever traps and enemies<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udca5 7 epic bosses that will test all your gaming skills<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udd04 180 handcrafted levels ensuring no two runs are alike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\ud83c\udfae <strong>Local multiplayer</strong>: Team up in <strong>co-op</strong> or compete in <strong>versus mode</strong>! <br>\u2022 \ud83d\udd13 Addictive progression: Unlock new characters and upgrades each run <br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfb5 Chiptune soundtrack that transports you to gaming's golden age</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you willing to risk it all for the treasure?</strong>\u00a0In Lost Vulcan, every jump and every shot could mean the difference between glory... and a premature death.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lost Vulcan - A roguelite platformer that revives the spirit of classic arcade games!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The legend of Vulcan is calling you... will you answer the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the depths of space lies Vulcan, a colossal abandoned ship that hides legendary riches, deadly traps, and foes that will push even the most experienced bounty hunters to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master the art of arcade survival:</strong><br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfae Precise classic-style controls with the depth of modern roguelites<br>\u2022 \ud83e\udde9 6 unique zones filled with clever traps and enemies<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udca5 7 epic bosses that will test all your gaming skills<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udd04 180 handcrafted levels ensuring no two runs are alike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\ud83c\udfae <strong>Local multiplayer</strong>: Team up in <strong>co-op</strong> or compete in <strong>versus mode</strong>! <br>\u2022 \ud83d\udd13 Addictive progression: Unlock new characters and upgrades each run <br>\u2022 \ud83c\udfb5 Chiptune soundtrack that transports you to gaming's golden age</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Are you willing to risk it all for the treasure?</strong>\u00a0In Lost Vulcan, every jump and every shot could mean the difference between glory... and a premature death.</p>",
